#: ../../../about.rst:8
msgid ""
"This site is built with `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org/>`__, on top of "
"its built-in ``basic`` theme. From there it has been heavily customized: the "
"layout, navigation, search, dark mode, code blocks, mobile behavior, and "
"many small details were rebuilt or extended specifically for these docs."
