msgstr ""

#: ../../../about.rst:59
msgid ""
"Identifiers in code blocks (e.g. ``p = psutil.Process()``, ``p."
"cpu_percent()``) are clickable. Hover over one of those to see the "
"highlight, then click to jump to the corresponding API reference doc. This "
"is powered by `sphinx-codeautolink <https://sphinx-codeautolink.readthedocs."
"io/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about.rst:64
msgid "Clickable API reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about.rst:69
msgid "Copy buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../about.rst:71
msgid ""
"Every code block has a copy button in its top-right corner which appears on "
"hover. For interactive (``>>>``) examples it copies just the code, leaving "
"out the prompts and the output, so you can paste it straight into a shell."
msgstr ""

