#: ../../../about.rst:82
msgid ""
"Press :kbd:`Ctrl+K` to jump straight to the search box. Once results appear, "
"use the :kbd:`↑` and :kbd:`↓` arrow keys to move through them and :kbd:"
"`Enter` to open one."
msgstr ""

