msgstr ""

#: ../../../about.rst:114
msgid ""
"On a phone the navigation collapses behind the **☰** button in the top bar. "
"Tap it to open the menu, then swipe left anywhere on the page (or tap "
"outside it) to close it again."
msgstr ""

